  },
  "body": "In the absence of a `data-dfn-type` attribute, this definition was being\r\nassigned a type of \"attribute\" by the Bikeshed tool. This is not the\r\ncorrect type for the definition.\r\n\r\nExplicitly declare the type as \"dfn\" in order to avoid relying on\r\nBikeshed's type inference logic.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis patch is intended to support https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/pull/1144.\r\n\r\n/cc @domenic @tabatkins\r\n",
